---

<section class="section-solution">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center header">
            <span class="badge">SOLUTION</span>
            <h2>매출로 직결되는<br />2단계 필수 플랫폼</h2>
            <p class="summary">
                중국인 관광객의 여행 동선에 맞춰<br
                    class="mobile-only"
                />빈틈없이 노출합니다.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="solution-wrapper">
            <!-- Xiaohongshu -->
            <div class="card xhs">
                <div class="card-head">
                    <div class="platform-badge red">Xiaohongshu</div>
                    <h3>샤오홍슈</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="role">
                    방문 전 <span class="highlight">탐색 & 저장</span>
                </div>
                <p class="desc">
                    "한국 여행 어디 가지?"<br />
                    인스타그램 + 네이버 블로그 성격.<br />
                    잠재 고객에게 매력을 어필하고<br />
                    <strong>위시리스트</strong>에 담게 합니다.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Arrow -->
            <div class="connector">
                <div class="arrow-line"></div>
                <div class="arrow-text">연결</div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dianping -->
            <div class="card dp">
                <div class="card-head">
                    <div class="platform-badge orange">Dianping</div>
                    <h3>따종디엔핑</h3>
                </div>
                <div class="role">
                    방문 직전 <span class="highlight">검증 & 결정</span>
                </div>
                <p class="desc">
                    "여기 진짜 맛있나?"<br />
                    구글맵 + 망고플레이트 성격.<br />
                    위치와 별점, 리뷰를 확인하고<br />
                    <strong>최종 방문</strong>을 확정합니다.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .section-solution {
        background-color: white;
    }

    .header {
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 6px 16px;
        background: #fff0f0; /* Red tint */
        color: #e02f2f;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        border-radius: 100px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    }

    h2 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 1.3;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .summary {
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    .solution-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 2rem;
    }

    .card {
        flex: 1;
        max-width: 400px;
        background: #f8f9fa;
        border: 1px solid #eee;
        padding: 2.5rem;
        border-radius: 24px;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
        transition:
            transform 0.3s ease,
            box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    /* Xiaohongshu styling */
    .xhs:hover {
        border-color: #ff2442;
    }
    .platform-badge.red {
        background: #ff2442;
        color: white;
    }

    /* Dianping styling */
    .dp:hover {
        border-color: #ff9900;
    }
    .platform-badge.orange {
        background: #ff9900;
        color: white;
    }

    .card-head {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .platform-badge {
        padding: 4px 12px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    }

    h3 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .role {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px dashed #ddd;
    }

    .highlight {
        background: linear-gradient(
            120deg,
            rgba(255, 192, 0, 0.2) 0%,
            rgba(255, 192, 0, 0) 100%
        );
        padding-right: 5px;
    }

    .desc {
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        line-height: 1.7;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .connector {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        color: var(--color-text-sub);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }

    .arrow-line {
        width: 60px;
        height: 2px;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ccc, #333, #ccc);
        margin-bottom: 4px;
        position: relative;
    }

    /* Make arrow nice */
    .arrow-line::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        right: 0;
        top: -4px;
        width: 10px;
        height: 10px;
        border-top: 2px solid #333;
        border-right: 2px solid #333;
        transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .solution-wrapper {
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .connector {
            transform: rotate(90deg);
        }
        .mobile-only {
            display: block;
        }
        .card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 100%;
        }
    }

    @media (min-width: 769px) {
        .mobile-only {
            display: none;
        }
    }
</style>
